{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2022-11-18 12:15:00', 'title': 'CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "CINCINNATI , NOV.\xa018, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) ANNOUNCED THAT AT TODAY'S REGULAR MEETING, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A 69-CENTS-PER-SHARE REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND. THE\xa0DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JANUARY 13, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 16, 2022."}